.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH kannadi-type 1  "type 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
kannadi\-type \- Show the Kannada words for words typed in English letters, best first
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBkannadi type\fR [\fB\-n \fR] [\fB\-\-prev\fR] [\fB\-\-scores\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIWORDS\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the Kannada words for words typed in English letters, best first
.PP
Spellings may be loose: kannada, kannda and kanada all give ಕನ್ನಡ. Capitals follow Baraha when they appear inside a word, as in kannaDa. The first word is what the letters spell; later ones may be longer words the letters only start.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 5]
How many words to show for each
.TP
\fB\-\-prev\fR \fI<WORD>\fR
The Kannada word before, which can change the order
.TP
\fB\-\-scores\fR
Show 1 word per line, with its score and kind: word, spelling (not in the word list) or completion
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIWORDS\fR>
Words in English letters
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  kannadi type kannada
  kannadi type \-\-prev ನನ್ನ hesaru
  kannadi type \-\-scores \-n 10 til
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
